        "url_AZG2G2qwuKbemhzA": "",
        "text_fFLU4W1wUVubESYw": "<p>See it in action</p>",
        "text_7Vd7UpSaEr14Fiis": "<p><strong>40% of people also add:</strong></p>",
        "product_vhbzilb4g95S0Es5": "lio®-complete",
        "text_VOoU6028MasdmFjl": "<h3>Classic Complete </h3>",
        "text_BxcEID7UsxYPnloM": "<p>60 days of Flavour Cores</p>",
        "product_p2nw7NkeoFVKMujO": "lio®-diffuser",
        "text_Ivva6YnbOqZHu9PL": "<h3>Classic Olive </h3>",
        "text_CHVeoIOgQO9kG2R7": "<p>Premium Olive Wood</p>",
        "product_1oiQHbuLJrWvbRzR": "lio®-diffuser",
        "text_mSnyBXMv9t7Ewilr": "<h3>Classic Walnut </h3>",
        "text_VoYVgRKADDEwZqRs": "<p>Premium Walnut Wood</p>",
        "text_It9p5ddghAwNvspT": "<p>Daniel Foster</p>",
        "text_0qDFOeN5p1idqKG9": "<p>14 Mar 2025</p>",
        "text_V9HCt0mp35D9DBGX": "<p>“Lio has made quitting so much easier. It’s so convenient that I don’t even have to think about cravings anymore. I just pick it up, take a breath, and move on with my day—no stress, no nicotine, no bad habits. Thank you!”</p>",
        "text_bGKuQktTvumS7xz8": "<p><strong>Eva A.</strong></p>",
        "text_ucag6EenSRgFzceB": "<p>26 Jun 2025</p>",
        "text_iza08atvvkmuy3pS": "<p>I’ve been a smoker for 7 years and the other methods to stop weren’t helping me because I had a mouth vice, with breathelio I gave up smoking right away! I’ve been smoke free for more than a month now, I strongly recommend, your health is worth the small investment</p>",
        "text_YT7E6ZMSvTTS9Qve": "<p><strong>Biohackgym</strong></p>",
        "text_Tdw57imMUyCN9p8w": "<p>02 Jun 2025</p>",
        "text_lqConwLPcdIqdg1q": "<p>Healthy habits! This can help quit smoking but also stop sugar cravings. Biohackgym can help you with healthy lifestyle coaching and the Lio is a good tool to support that.</p>",
        "text_1h27k5CkJty9fKfp": "<p><strong>Lee F.</strong></p>",
        "text_JJIxMJqbN2T3Lwb0": "<p>27 Mar 2025</p>",
        "text_qUBnzie0zgffHOxk": "<p>I’ve been using now for 2 weeks and it has done the job. I’m off the vapes and just use this as and when I need but slowly using less but great to have to hand.</p>",
        "text_BjbbD5nuFmmMOJED": "<p><strong>Julius Raphael S.</strong></p>",
        "text_GB0vTangKpNXZZjH": "<p>25 Apr 2025</p>",
        "text_T4ECc4wT0toEplQE": "<p>I love my Lio for its design, its great flavors, and as a clean, healthy ritual that relieves stress.</p>",
        "text_FbCiVrptb17NE3hF": "<p>Breathe Clean</p>",
        "text_mz3dFUQ0G61Gfzez": "<p>Nicotine-free, smoke-free, and effortless to use</p>",
        "text_yCfKiaNRIN728llC": "<p>Anytime, Anywhere</p>",
        "text_9emUTDk7xbRJaxR8": "<p>Pause, adjust, or cancel anytime—your routine, your rules</p>",
        "text_417rd5taQbmbSY8F": "<p>30-Day Guarantee</p>",
        "text_JCzCrjffyEtqLRrB": "<p>Not satisfied? Return it, no questions asked</p>",
        "tab_title_Q8P4DS7jJwTn06hz": "Whats included",
        "text_D5lu3nXA14yx80x1": "<p>Lio Device</p>",
        "text_2ntnCHUpdiXp1fFz": "<p>Sleek, durable design that fits perfectly in your pocket. Reusable for life - just replace the cores.</p>",
        "text_1POBW1Fgbns7tSmx": "<p>18 Flavor Cores (60-Day Supply)</p>",
        "text_SuTkYOjx6TfQiRln": "<p>Mix of mint, citrus, and spice flavors. Each core lasts 3-4 days of regular use.</p>",
        "text_iNplE43Rhh8bathv": "<p>Custom Habit Tracker</p>",
        "text_YsabW8CgjH2hHhY0": "<p>We hold your hand & keep you on track</p>",
        "tab_title_lsqGEN49MoluYOch": "Your wallet",
        "text_2mpoWEHFDKynguh6": "<p>What You're Spending Now</p>",
        "text_1Gag6EGXZ5W2ssPF": "<p>$350/month or $4000/year</p>",
